# Model card: clothing classifier v2
- File hash: 6702b806fec5; size 0.38 MB. ResNet-20, int8 static quantization (Chapter 28).
- Trained on fashion-mnist (data hash 3aede38d6186), code commit unknown.
- Intended use: tagging product photos of 10 garment types (28x28 grayscale).
- Test accuracy 92.87%; weakest class: Shirt (78.2%).
- Known limitations: confident on blank and non-garment images (use an outlier detector);
  accuracy drops on darker photos than those in training (monitor input brightness).
